# Connectivity Testing

Using the **ping** command, I verified connectivity between the devices.

Successful tests:

- Ping to Default Gateway (192.168.5.1)
- Ping from PC2 to PC1
- Ping from PC2 to PC0

All packets were transmitted successfully with **0% packet loss**, confirming proper network connectivity.

